\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The Spherepop semantic pipeline. Contextual restriction ($\operatorname  {\textsc  {Bind}}$) narrows the option space; irreversible commitment ($\operatorname  {\textsc  {Pop}}$) records selections in the append-only history; and observable state is reconstructed by applying $\operatorname  {\textsc  {Collapse}}$ to the resulting commitment sequence. In this formulation observable states are derived objects; the primary semantic structure is the append-only history of commitments.}}{29}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
